      "content": "To address the more conservative concerns, explicitly dedicate a strong section to **\"Preservation of Core Tangible and Intangible Heritage,\"\n\n  A strong talking point here is that **strong, vibrant single-culture roots are the *best foundation for successful, stable integration,\n\n  Propose \"bifurcating support,\" meaning the budget will fund ** both the dedicated support for traditional landmark preservation *and* the necessary community dialogue for modern inclusion\n\n  This shows you are **respecting the historical perspective while championing a necessary, balanced future for the town",
